&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle for Clara Contabilidad—from prospecting to demo to close—targeting business owners (personas físicas/morales, RESICOs) and accounting teams managing multiple companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Generate a robust pipeline through relentless outbound prospecting using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;73&quot;&gt;Amplemarket&lt;/strong&gt;, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, cold outreach, and creative approaches to reach CFOs and Finance Managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Lead compelling product demos that showcase our core value: instant RFC connection, automatic CFDI sync, AI-powered tax estimates, and proactive SAT compliance alerts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Manage a large, active, high-volume pipeline in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;48&quot;&gt;HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt; with rigorous hygiene, accurate forecasting, and full activity tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;Apply structured qualification methodologies (like BANT) to prioritize deals, move them quickly, and consistently exceed monthly and quarterly ARR targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot;&gt;Relay market intelligence, prospect feedback, and SAT regulatory changes to the Product team via &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt;, actively shaping the evolving product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate seamlessly with Legal, Finance, Operations, and Customer Success to ensure tailored onboarding, smooth handoffs, and rapid time-to-value for every new client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
