&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Your Sales Career at Clara&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Clara, we don’t just offer a sales job—we provide an environment designed for high performance, long-term wealth, and continuous career growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Leave Behind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have been in sales long enough, you know the industry’s bad habits. We actively reject them:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No “Rolodex” Hiring:&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t hire just for connections. We value professionals who actually care to learn our product, solve real customer problems, and know how to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No “Churn and Burn”:&lt;/strong&gt; We reject the revolving door culture. When we hire you, we invest in your quick success and long-term retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Clara Sales Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We engineered a transparent system built to help you win big:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Ownership (Uncapped Potential):&lt;/strong&gt; We deeply value the Individual Contributor. Our top-performing AEs consistently earn more than their managers, backed by absolutely zero commission caps and access to company equity. In our servant leadership model, even our CEO is building tools to help your productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Simplicity &amp;amp; #Clarity (Transparent Compensation):&lt;/strong&gt; No complex math required. Your variable compensation is directly aligned with business goals, with real-time visibility over your metrics so you always know exactly where you stand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Inclusivity (Teamwork Meets Territory):&lt;/strong&gt; We carve out clear, fair territories so you can autonomously run your own book of business, backed by a highly collaborative global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Pride (A Product That Delivers):&lt;/strong&gt; We build exceptional spend management products that actually solve the customer’s pain points, making your pitching process smoother and more impactful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#ABC (An Expanding Arsenal):&lt;/strong&gt; We never settle. Continuous platform innovation and new product launches mean you always have an ever-growing toolkit to cross-sell and hit your targets faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first role: you&#39;ll work from home day to day. You&#39;ll ramp up in person with the team, and come together in person for team moments, events and customer visits through the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Account Executive - Fleet &amp;amp; Mobility Specialist to prospect and win companies with vehicle fleets that value efficient management, want to reduce the costs of their current systems, and are looking for innovation. Your goal will be to expand adoption of Clara Vehicles, showing how our solution delivers more control, visibility, and savings in fleet fuel and expense management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your main responsibilities will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospect and win clients: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify medium and large fleet companies in the transportation, distribution, delivery, utilities, field services, and industrial sectors. Generate qualified opportunities through active prospecting and strategic outreach using Amplemarket, owning the full sales cycle through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and manage the pipeline: &lt;/strong&gt;Build a strong pipeline of opportunities, prioritize strategic accounts, and track metrics in HubSpot, keeping data up to date and maintaining strong execution discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run consultative sales: &lt;/strong&gt;Understand clients&#39; current fuel management, maintenance, and travel processes, and demonstrate Clara&#39;s return on investment through parameterized controls, dynamic limits, and real-time visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiate with Finance and Operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead negotiations with multiple decision-makers, aligning the operational needs of fleet and logistics managers with the financial priorities of CFOs, treasurers, and controllers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive product adoption: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with the commercial team to ensure cards and platform access are used by drivers and managers, expanding adoption and total payment volume (TPV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the evolution of Clara Vehicles: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a product champion and share customer learnings with this BU&#39;s Leadership and with the Product and Technology teams to improve the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop market opportunities: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify strategic partnerships in the fuel and mobility sectors, and track industry and competitor trends to support Clara&#39;s positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support organizing Clara&#39;s own fleet and mobility events: &lt;/strong&gt;Plan and run Clara events with clients, partners, and strategic industry stakeholders, strengthening relationships, promoting Clara Vehicles, and generating new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience in B2B sales, commercial roles, field sales, or business development in the fintech, payments, fleet management, or fuel sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in the fuel payments and fleet management market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hunter profile, with a track record of high-volume active prospecting, complex negotiations, and managing the full sales cycle from opportunity identification to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to financial decision-makers such as CFOs, treasurers, and controllers, and an understanding of corporate expense management, cash flow, and treasury challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of tax regulations applicable to fuel expenses and of the regulations related to the payment methods used in the sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of logistics operations, driver expense management, and waste, loss, and fraud prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run SaaS platform demos and translate features into concrete customer benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in São Paulo or the surrounding area, with availability to work in person at the office at least 3 times a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, intermediate level or above, enough to read documentation, use tools, and take part in internal alignments over Slack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or interest in AI tools to automate sales processes, support prospecting, and increase outreach efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication, adaptability to constantly changing environments, and a proven ability to execute commercially.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in vehicle rental or telematics companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HubSpot and Amplemarket for pipeline management and prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network in the transportation, industrial, and distribution sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing commercial partnerships in the fuel and mobility markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Spanish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where we work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid position: you&#39;ll split your time between the office (Inside Sales), in-person client visits (Field Sales), and home. For most roles, we don&#39;t set a minimum number of in-office days - office presence happens naturally, tending to be more frequent during your initial onboarding and ramp-up period, or when requested by leadership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
