&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive to lead Clara&#39;s Government segment&lt;/strong&gt; in Mexico. You&#39;ll be responsible for building the commercial strategy, sales processes, and customer portfolio for this segment from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
