&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage the full sales cycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate public procurement processes, including competitive tenders, direct awards, invitation-based procedures, and vendor qualification requirements, from initial engagement through contract signing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead consultative sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver product demonstrations and presentations to decision-makers and key stakeholders, positioning Clara against existing solutions and competitors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely with Risk:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate to define eligibility criteria, commercial terms, and offering guidelines, ensuring a competitive solution for the public sector while maintaining Clara&#39;s risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the segment internally:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of Government customers across Product and Leadership teams, sharing customer requirements, objections, competitive insights, and procurement feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own pipeline management and forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a well-structured pipeline and accurate forecasts in HubSpot, applying disciplined qualification processes to long and complex sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver commercial results:&lt;/strong&gt; Achieve quarterly and annual targets for new customer acquisition and segment transaction volume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
