&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with executive and operational leaders to implement agent-based or rule-based automation that drastically improves speed, accuracy, and capacity—scaling the business without linearly adding headcount.&lt;/p&gt;
