&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;AI Content Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape how Clara shows up across our organic channels and bring our brand to life through relevant, thoughtful, and engaging content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who genuinely loves creating content. You know how to write a strong article, turn an idea into a LinkedIn post, adapt to an executive&#39;s tone of voice, script a video, and work with designers to bring a concept to life. You&#39;re equally comfortable thinking about the bigger story and obsessing over the small details that make the final piece great.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We think about this role as AI-native. AI isn&#39;t a shortcut bolted onto content work, it&#39;s part of how the work gets designed and produced in the first place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work across Clara&#39;s main content channels—including our corporate and leadership LinkedIn profiles, blog, website, and video—with occasional support for other social platforms and paid initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who is chronically online in the best possible way: curious about what&#39;s happening on the internet, attentive to how brands and creators communicate, and constantly spotting formats, conversations, and trends that Clara can participate in without forcing it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Most importantly, we want someone who takes ownership. You can start with a blank page, develop an idea, write the copy, brief and collaborate with design, gather feedback and approvals, and make sure the final piece actually gets published—and published well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Create high-quality content across Clara&#39;s organic channels, including LinkedIn, blog articles, website content, video scripts, executive communications, and other social media formats using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Google Drive&lt;/strong&gt; for seamless document collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Treat AI as core infrastructure for how content gets made, not just a drafting shortcut. Go beyond prompting — build and maintain real automations that connect tools using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;172&quot;&gt;N8N&lt;/strong&gt; or custom GPTs to take repetitive work off your plate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Write and execute content for Clara&#39;s leadership team, adapting to established voices and ensuring each piece feels authentic to the person publishing it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Own content projects end-to-end: develop concepts, write copy, coordinate with designers, manage feedback and approvals, and schedule or publish final pieces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities for video and spontaneous content around our offices, people, customers, and events, capturing raw content and collaborating with designers on final output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Stay close to internet culture and trends relevant to our audience, translating them into meaningful B2B fintech communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Maintain a consistently high editorial bar across all channels, paying strict attention to language, tone, formatting, visual execution, and audio/video quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
