&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Compliance Lawyer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Compliance team and act as a strategic advisor for our rapidly expanding business in Latin America. This role moves beyond operational queues to focus on regulatory analysis, legal risk management, and compliance advisory. You will serve as a dual Legal and Compliance expert, supporting the business across our current operations and strategic roadmap, including SOFOM, Fleetcard, stablecoins, and our upcoming SOFIPO process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Act as a dual Legal and Compliance expert, providing actionable regulatory guidance to Product, Commercial, and Operations teams to ensure compliance without slowing down business momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Navigate and advise on Mexican financial regulations, overseeing complex AML/CFT (Prevención de Lavado de Dinero) matters, corporate structures, UBOs, and powers of attorney.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Support Clara&#39;s regulatory transition and expansion in Mexico, actively contributing to the legal and compliance structuring for our SOFIPO process, stablecoin initiatives, and Fleetcard offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and advise on compliance-related provisions in commercial contracts, product terms, and partnerships as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;Serve as an escalation point for complex KYC/KYB and due diligence cases, providing clear, evidence-based legal recommendations and drafting objective case notes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot;&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot;&gt;Google Drive&lt;/strong&gt; to embed compliance into product design and operational workflows from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to use AI and workflow automation (such as &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot;&gt;N8N&lt;/strong&gt;) to streamline legal research, regulatory monitoring, and compliance reviews, making the function more scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;Law degree and active registration as a licensed lawyer in Mexico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven experience in Mexican financial regulation, AML/CFT (Prevención de Lavado de Dinero), and compliance for regulated businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;A strong dual profile (Legal + Compliance), capable of seamlessly shifting between regulatory advisory, compliance operations oversight, and commercial/contractual support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate complex regulatory frameworks into practical business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills to influence cross-functional stakeholders and explain evidence-based recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;Experience or strong interest in using AI tools to automate workflows and improve legal/compliance processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot;&gt;Adaptability to fast-changing environments, with proven role-specific execution in navigating complex regulatory landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Direct legal or compliance experience navigating SOFOM, SOFIPO, or crypto/stablecoin regulatory frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience reviewing customers or regulatory requirements in Brazil or Colombia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Independent analytical skills using spreadsheets, SQL, or Python to monitor compliance metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Basic proficiency in Portuguese, or a strong desire to learn it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Compliance Operations Analyst based in Sao Paulo/ SP to join the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance team and report directly to the Head of Legal &amp;amp; Compliance. The role will support customer onboarding, ongoing reviews and the operational AML/CFT agenda across Brazil, Mexico and Colombia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage high-volume casework with sound judgment, clear evidence and reliable execution, while helping us improve controls, workflows and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review onboarding, remediation and reassessment cases for customers in Brazil, Mexico and Colombia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze corporate documents, ownership structures, Ultimate Beneficial Owners (UBOs), business models, expected activity and the consistency of customer information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform KYC/KYB and enhanced due diligence, including PEP, sanctions and adverse-media screening, and document the rationale for each conclusion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute ongoing transaction monitoring and review AML/CFT alerts from initial assessment through documented closure or escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate unusual or potentially suspicious activity, request additional information, conduct enhanced reviews and escalate cases in line with internal governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the full range of operational AML/CFT activities assigned to Compliance, including periodic and event-driven reviews, customer-risk classification, control execution, remediation and the preparation of internal or regulatory reporting inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply the KYC Manual, AML/CFT policies, risk criteria, checklists, SLAs and escalation rules consistently across cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain complete, accurate and auditable records of evidence, pending items, decisions, approvals and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Compliance pipeline by risk, priority and SLA, providing visibility into volumes, aging, backlogs and material exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate higher-risk cases, exceptions and matters requiring a risk decision to the appropriate Compliance leadership or governance forum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Operations, Fraud, Risk, Credit, Product, Engineering and Data to resolve process gaps and strengthen preventive and detective controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support AML/CFT risk assessments, quality reviews, control testing, metrics, procedures, playbooks and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for responsible automation and contribute to requirements, testing, implementation and ongoing validation while preserving human review and auditability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in Compliance Operations, KYC, KYB, AML/CFT, transaction monitoring or customer onboarding, ideally in a fintech, financial institution or payments company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience reviewing legal entities, UBOs, ownership structures, customer documentation and AML/CFT alerts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of customer due diligence, enhanced due diligence, PEP and sanctions screening, adverse media and suspicious-activity escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage high-volume queues, meet SLAs and maintain clear, complete and auditable case records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment, attention to detail and the ability to apply policies consistently while recognizing when escalation is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership, organization and clear communication across multiple teams and countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Portuguese and professional working proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AML/CFT requirements or Compliance operations in Brazil, Mexico or Colombia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using case-management, screening or transaction-monitoring tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting regulatory reporting, audits, control testing or remediation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong interest in workflow automation, data analysis or the responsible use of AI in Compliance operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;380&quot; data-end=&quot;398&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;708&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot;&gt;Control Desk &amp;amp; Credit Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to support the safe and scalable growth of Clara&#39;s portfolio in Brazil. This role is essential to ensuring the effectiveness of our automated onboarding flows, while applying rigorous &lt;strong data-start=&quot;638&quot; data-end=&quot;645&quot;&gt;KYC&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;647&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;KYB&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;667&quot;&gt;CDD&lt;/strong&gt; standards to business customer accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;710&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work in close partnership with Sales, Compliance, and Customer teams, ensuring that onboarding processes are completed efficiently and accurately—without compromising on quality. This role requires a strong analytical mindset and a collaborative approach, as you&#39;ll be helping build scalable internal controls that support Clara’s long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1088&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1089&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1089&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;Monitor and review onboarding processes to ensure accuracy and adherence to internal controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales and other Customer-facing teams to complete timely and thorough &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1286&quot;&gt;KYC/KYB&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1291&quot; data-end=&quot;1298&quot;&gt;CDD&lt;/strong&gt; reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;Flag and escalate inconsistencies or risks in real time, ensuring we meet our internal &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1397&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;SLA&lt;/strong&gt;s and compliance standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1432&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot;&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of policies and procedures, and contribute to a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1549&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally to identify bottlenecks or risks and support automation and process enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;1829&quot; data-end=&quot;1844&quot;&gt;Must haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1432&quot;&gt;Financial Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Credit Risk Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;KYC&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1478&quot;&gt;CDD&lt;/strong&gt;, or related risk and compliance functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Strong analytical rigor to credit evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1522&quot; data-end=&quot;1649&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1649&quot;&gt;Proven ability to interpret &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;financial statements&lt;/strong&gt; (Balance Sheet, Income Statement, Cash Flow) for credit decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1652&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;Excel&lt;/strong&gt; and confidence working with large datasets and financial indicators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1852&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1852&quot;&gt;Solid numerical skills and an analytical mindset, capable of connecting metrics to risk exposure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1934&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1855&quot; data-end=&quot;1934&quot;&gt;Intermediate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1868&quot; data-end=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; proficiency and working proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1935&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; to automate workflows and improve analysis efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2238&quot; data-end=&quot;2256&quot;&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2042&quot; data-end=&quot;2117&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2117&quot;&gt;Experience in a high-growth startup or tech-driven financial institution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2118&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;Basic proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;Spanish&lt;/strong&gt;, or the motivation to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2182&quot; data-end=&quot;2277&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2277&quot;&gt;Exposure to quantitative models (e.g., Z-Score, logistic regression) for solvency prediction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2278&quot; data-end=&quot;2349&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2349&quot;&gt;Independent analytical skills using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2332&quot;&gt;spreadsheets&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2348&quot;&gt;BI tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
