&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2339&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first role: you&#39;ll work from home day to day. You&#39;ll ramp up in person with the team, and come together in person for team moments, events and customer visits through the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Happiness Associate – Key Accounts&lt;/strong&gt; to support our mission of delivering a seamless, human, and high-quality customer experience to some of Clara’s most strategic customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be one of Clara’s main points of contact for our &lt;strong&gt;Key Accounts and premium customers&lt;/strong&gt;, providing high-touch support, managing complex requests and ensuring an excellent experience throughout every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong ownership, organization and communication skills, as you’ll support customers with differentiated service expectations and SLAs, including situations that may require urgency, coordination across teams or proactive follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with other Customer Happiness team members, as well as cross-functional teams such as Product, Engineering, Operations and other areas involved in the customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your working hours will be from 11:00 to 20:00 BRT, Monday through Friday.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling and resolving customer inquiries across multiple channels, including &lt;strong&gt;email, chat, WhatsApp and phone&lt;/strong&gt;, with a high standard of quality and responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing high-touch support to &lt;strong&gt;Key Accounts and premium B2B customers&lt;/strong&gt;, understanding their context, priorities and specific service expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing requests according to established &lt;strong&gt;SLAs and priority levels&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring timely follow-ups and clear communication throughout the resolution process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating complex issues thoroughly and documenting findings and actions clearly in our internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership of customer cases from initial contact through resolution, coordinating with internal teams whenever necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively reaching out to customers to provide updates, solutions and support, including follow-up calls when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing critical or escalated situations with calm, empathy, clarity and a strong sense of urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trust and long-term relationships by understanding each customer&#39;s context and providing thoughtful, personalized support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying recurring issues, customer feedback and opportunities to improve processes and the overall Key Accounts experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with Product, Engineering, Operations and other internal stakeholders to resolve customer needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering support with a consistently high bar for &lt;strong&gt;quality, accuracy and excellence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing multiple tickets, conversations and priorities simultaneously while maintaining strong organization and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. Preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2+ years of experience in Customer Support, Customer Experience, Customer Success or a similar customer-facing role&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in a Fintech or B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience supporting &lt;strong&gt;B2B customers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Previous experience providing support to Key Accounts, premium/VIP customers, strategic accounts or customer segments with differentiated service levels and SLAs.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience providing customer support through multiple channels, including chat, email, WhatsApp and phone.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex or high-priority customer cases while meeting established response and resolution SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to remain calm under pressure, demonstrate empathy and communicate clearly with different customer profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and ability to investigate and resolve issues autonomously, while knowing when and how to engage other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and prioritization skills, particularly when managing multiple customers and requests with different levels of urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the São Paulo metropolitan region, with availability to occasionally work from Clara’s local office (Itaim Bibi).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability to work from 11:00 to 20:00 BRT, Monday through Friday.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Drive and Office tools (Advanced).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using customer support platforms such as Zendesk or similar tools (Advanced).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM tools such as HubSpot or similar platforms (Intermediate).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Portuguese and Intermediate English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in &lt;strong&gt;Fintech, financial services, SaaS or technology companies serving enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-value or strategic customer portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
