&lt;li&gt;Basic proficiency in Spanish or a desire to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze customer support trends and operational data using spreadsheets, SQL or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with metrics such as SLA, CSAT, FCR, response time and resolution time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership potential and the ability to handle complexity with calm, clarity and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
