&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CS Metrics Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of core Customer Success performance indicators (Retention, Churn Risk, NPS/CSAT, Time-to-Onboard, and Account Health).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Proactivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and a self-starter mindset capable of managing day-to-day operational requests in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
