&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Director &lt;/strong&gt;to help lead and scale our engineering organization as we build the next generation of financial technology that empowers and increases the competitiveness of Latin American organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role for someone who combines &lt;strong&gt;strong technical judgment, people leadership, platform and systems-scale thinking, and business acumen&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead multiple engineering teams, develop engineering leaders and IC builders, shape our technical strategy, and ensure we continue to increase our execution velocity while maintaining the reliability, security, and quality expected from a regulated fintech platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also play an important role in how we leverage &lt;strong&gt;AI across our products and engineering organization&lt;/strong&gt;, helping us identify opportunities to improve customer experiences, automate complex workflows, and increase engineering productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who thrives in a &lt;strong&gt;high-growth, fast-moving environment&lt;/strong&gt;, is comfortable navigating ambiguity, and can move naturally between strategy, technology, people, and direct execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruit, lead and scale engineering teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead multiple teams building a high-performance culture based on ownership, collaboration, speed, and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop exceptional builders.&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and grow senior engineers while strengthening our leadership pipeline and raising the talent bar across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our engineering strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and business leaders to translate company priorities into a clear technical strategy and engineering roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive execution at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure teams consistently deliver high-impact products while balancing speed, quality, reliability, and long-term technical investments.&lt;/li&gt;
