&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of engineering leadership experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally recruiting and leading multiple teams in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and scaling &lt;strong&gt;high-performing engineering organizations&lt;/strong&gt; in fast-growing technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
