&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to be an ML researcher, but you should understand how modern AI can be translated into &lt;strong&gt;reliable products and meaningful engineering leverage&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;LLMs, AI-powered products, agentic systems, AI evaluation, guardrails, or AI-assisted engineering workflows&lt;/strong&gt; is highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;
