&lt;p&gt;Engineering is at the core of how we build and scale our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Director, you will have the opportunity to shape not only our technology, but also &lt;strong&gt;how our engineering organization operates, how we develop our people, and how we use AI to build better products and move faster&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to have a meaningful impact on the next stage of our growth and help build the technology and engineering organization that will take us there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
