&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Fraud Strategist Expert&lt;/strong&gt; to shape and scale Clara&#39;s global fraud detection strategy across all markets and fraud vectors. Fraud prevention at Clara goes beyond reacting to suspicious transactions—it&#39;s about building intelligent, scalable systems that stay ahead of evolving fraud threats. This is a senior Individual Contributor role reporting to the Head of Fraud. You will combine deep fraud expertise, strong analytical judgment, and a builder mindset focused on AI and automation to ensure innovation is balanced with strong governance and effective risk controls.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own global fraud detection strategies, methodologies, and standards across fraud vectors, ensuring consistency and effectiveness across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the evolution of Clara&#39;s fraud detection infrastructure, including rule engines, machine learning models, risk signals, and case management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the AI and automation roadmap for fraud detection, identifying opportunities to automate alert triage, investigations, decision-making, and operational workflows using tools like &lt;strong&gt;N8N&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and implement AI-powered detection capabilities, including anomaly detection, behavioral analysis, intelligent alerts, and automated rule optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate emerging fraud threats, including AI-enabled fraud, synthetic identities, deepfakes, and evolving attack patterns, and develop robust mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
