&lt;li&gt;Independently monitor and challenge regional fraud detection performance, identifying gaps, risks, and opportunities for improvement using data platforms like &lt;strong&gt;Databricks&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
