&lt;li&gt;Define automation and monitoring strategies that enable 24/7 fraud detection coverage, reducing manual dependencies while maintaining effective controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear KPIs and performance frameworks to measure detection effectiveness, automation coverage, model performance, and platform reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
