&lt;li&gt;Lead by example: being involved in building your own solutions using AI coding models (&lt;strong&gt;Claude&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Codex&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Cursor&lt;/strong&gt;, open source models, etc.) and manage an organization that includes agents and people fully empowered by AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer an AI-first approach to customer experience, defining how artificial intelligence, workflow automation (such as &lt;strong&gt;N8N&lt;/strong&gt;), and self-service solutions can dramatically improve the customer journey, boost team productivity, and drive operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop Customer Happiness leaders across Mexico, Brazil, and Colombia, creating a high-performance, customer-centric organization with strong operational rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the global Customer Happiness strategy, OKRs, KPIs, and service standards, ensuring strong execution and continuous improvement across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously optimize key metrics such as NPS, CSAT, SLA, response and resolution times, quality, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize and optimize processes across countries while maintaining the right level of local flexibility to meet regional needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic partner and key stakeholder to senior leaders and executives across Product, Engineering, Operations, etc. serving as the voice of the customer to influence company-wide strategy and solve recurring pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage customer data, feedback, and contact reasons (using BI tools like &lt;strong&gt;Databricks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt;) to identify root causes of user friction and turn insights into actionable improvements, communicating findings transparently via &lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Google Drive&lt;/strong&gt; documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the organization has the right talent, tools, capacity, and AI resources to seamlessly support Clara’s hyper-growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Customer Support, Customer Experience, Customer Operations, or related functions, with proven role-specific execution in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading leaders and scaling teams, ideally across multiple markets or business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning and improving customer experience and operational KPIs, including NPS, CSAT, SLA, quality, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience and a strong interest in using &lt;strong&gt;AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; to automate workflows, scale operations, and enhance customer satisfaction, treating AI as a core component of your operational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership and executive presence, with a proven track record of managing relationships with senior leaders and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset and ability to turn customer and operational data into clear actions and measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer service platforms such as &lt;strong&gt;Zendesk,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Intercom&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to fast-changing environments and a hands-on, builder&#39;s mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, banking, payments, SaaS, or B2B technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams across Mexico, Brazil, and/or Colombia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent analytical skills using spreadsheets, SQL, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on design role at the intersection of growth, performance marketing, and AI. You will design the assets and experiences that drive Clara&#39;s acquisition engine across Mexico, Brazil, and Colombia — ad creatives, landing pages, lifecycle journeys, and conversion flows — using AI tools as a core part of your daily workflow, from first prompt to final asset.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll help define what AI-augmented growth design looks like at scale, on a team that is actively building AI-native workflows into everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and produce performance creative at scale — static ads, video concepts, carousels, and social assets for Meta, Google, and LinkedIn — using AI tools (e.g. Midjourney, Ideogram, Runway, Figma AI) combined with strong design craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize landing pages and conversion flows, applying CRO best practices for hierarchy, scroll depth, and clarity — and partnering with the Paid Media team to A/B test and iterate until the metrics move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI daily to accelerate creative production: generating visual variants, exploring concepts, drafting layouts, and turning briefs into testable assets in hours, not weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a scalable creative system — templates, components, and brand-consistent asset libraries in Figma — so the Growth team ships faster across 3 markets and 3 languages (PT-BR, ES-MX, ES-CO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth - Paid Media to interpret creative performance data, generate hypotheses, and feed learnings back into the next iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run visual QA on assets and pages before they go live; keep the brand consistent across every touchpoint of the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scout, pilot, and adopt new AI design tools — you keep our creative stack ahead of the industry, and document workflows so the whole team levels up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use automation tools (e.g. n8n, Make, Zapier) to reduce repetitive production work and create scalable creative workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
