&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Colombia&#39;s largest companies still run spend on bank cards, spreadsheets and manual approvals. As Clara&#39;s Enterprise Account Executive in Cali, you&#39;ll sell to the finance leaders who want to fix that, and you&#39;ll own the long, multi-stakeholder cycles that come with large organizations: multi-entity structures, controls, procurement and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business:&lt;/strong&gt; own the full sales cycle for enterprise accounts in Colombia, from the first strategic conversation to contract signature, with rigorous forecasting and pipeline hygiene in HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with the C-suite:&lt;/strong&gt; lead high-stakes conversations with CFOs, treasurers and senior finance leaders, translating complex financial structures into a clear value proposition and positioning Clara as a strategic partner rather than a vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run multi-stakeholder cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; navigate procurement, legal, risk and IT reviews inside large organizations and keep momentum at every stage of a long buying process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; work with Risk, Product, Operations and Legal to shape the solution each account needs, and to deliver it after signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-sell:&lt;/strong&gt; grow the value of every account by bringing more of Clara&#39;s corporate products into your clients&#39; financial operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Must haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 5 years of quota-carrying enterprise or mid-market sales, or a steeper record of beating targets in less time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to senior finance stakeholders (CFOs, treasurers, controllers), and comfort leading conversations about financial products, risk and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of exceeding goals on new customers, TPV and credit lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous pipeline management in a CRM such as HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in English and Spanish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, research and deal-structuring skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Four-year college degree from an accredited institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with a modern prospecting stack (for example HubSpot, Apollo, Sales Navigator); we&#39;ll teach you the rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with structured qualification methods such as BANT, and with KPIs like meetings per week and activity per deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent analytical skills using spreadsheets or SQL to build business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fintech, banking, payments or corporate cards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have used AI or automation to research accounts, personalise outreach or cut CRM admin, and can show us how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 90 days:&lt;/strong&gt; a full pipeline built on your own research and segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By 12 months:&lt;/strong&gt; consistently at or above target on new customers, TPV and credit lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build your sales career at Clara&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Clara, we don&#39;t just offer a sales job—we provide an environment designed for high performance, long-term wealth, and continuous career growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll earn:&lt;/strong&gt; base salary plus uncapped commission and equity from day one. Your variable is tied directly to the accounts you close, and top-performing AEs consistently earn more than their managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we leave behind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have been in sales long enough, you know the industry&#39;s bad habits. We actively reject them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No &quot;Rolodex&quot; hiring:&lt;/strong&gt; We don&#39;t hire just for connections. We value professionals who actually care to learn our product, solve real customer problems, and know how to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No &quot;Churn and Burn&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; We reject the revolving door culture. When we hire you, we invest in your quick success and long-term retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
