&lt;li&gt;Drive Sales Growth in the Federal District and Central-West: Own the end-to-end sales cycle, identifying and pursuing new business opportunities to expand Clara&#39;s client base across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Brasília&#39;s Unique Business Landscape: Utilize your existing relationships among finance and operations leaders — including government-adjacent and public sector-linked enterprises — to generate high-quality leads in one of Brazil&#39;s most distinctive markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and Manage a Healthy Pipeline: Oversee lead generation, qualification, and closing, ensuring a consistent and predictable flow of new partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a Trusted Advisor to Your Clients: Understand their complex financial needs and deliver tailored solutions via the Clara platform, building long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Local Insights to Company Strategy: Work closely with Marketing and Product teams to bridge regional market dynamics with our broader growth agenda, using tools like HubSpot to track and optimize your impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a Tight Operation: Use Google Drive and automated workflows to maintain rigorous documentation and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must haves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in high-growth sales environments (SaaS or Fintech preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local Expertise: Currently based in Brasília with a strong, active network among finance leaders and key influencers in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Working proficiency in English and Portuguese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution: Proven track record of exceeding sales targets and managing complex negotiations independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: Ability to thrive in fast-changing environments and operate with high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-Savvy: Experience or strong interest in using AI tools and automation (like N8N or Slack) to improve sales workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Skills: Independent analytical skills using spreadsheets, SQL, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language: Basic proficiency in Spanish or a desire to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools: Prior experience using Amplemarket or HubSpot for outbound prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work in this territory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brasília is an emerging territory for Clara — there&#39;s no office to go into, so this role works remotely from Brasília day to day. You&#39;ll ramp up in person with the team, and come together in person for team moments, events and customer visits through the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

