&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who gets a kick out of turning &quot;how should Clara look and sound here?&quot; into a shipped campaign, a visual system, or a production workflow — by next week, not next quarter. You&#39;ll define how Clara looks, sounds, and feels everywhere our customers, prospects, and candidates encounter us: product, marketing, sales materials, events, social, recruiting, and the office itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a brand governance role. It&#39;s a build role. You&#39;ll set the visual identity and voice, create the systems that let the rest of the company ship on-brand work fast, and lead the designers, writers, and producers who bring it to life — with AI doing serious heavy lifting on production, personalization, and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join at a stage where Clara&#39;s brand is still being defined region-wide. That means real license to shape it — and real accountability for making it distinctive, consistent, and something customers and employees are genuinely proud to be associated with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Head of Design and partner closely with Product, Marketing, and Clara&#39;s founders on the moments that define the brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Clara&#39;s brand identity end to end: visual system, voice and tone, and the narrative that ties product, marketing, and culture together — and be accountable for whether it lands, not just whether it looks good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and lead a brand team — designers, writers, motion and production talent — recruiting exceptional people and creating the conditions for them to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build AI-powered brand production tooling: design and ship the workflows, templates, and AI-assisted systems that let non-designers across Clara produce on-brand work without bottlenecking every asset through your team. Think prompt libraries, generative image workflows, copy scaffolding, automated asset resizing — built and iterated, not just imagined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prototype fast, validate faster: go from brand brief to working asset or system in days, test it against real usage and perception, kill what doesn&#39;t work, and scale what does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set up the operating rhythm for brand work — intake, briefs, reviews, approvals — so work moves quickly without sacrificing quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead by making when it counts: concept development, art direction, and hands-on craft on Clara&#39;s highest-stakes brand moments — launches, campaigns, major events, the moments people remember.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Growth, and Sales to ensure brand shows up consistently across every customer touchpoint, from the website to the sales deck to the app itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with People and Recruiting to make Clara&#39;s employer brand as sharp and intentional as its customer-facing brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish the metrics and feedback loops that show whether brand investment is working — awareness, perception, consistency, and business impact — and report on it in plain, honest terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years in brand, creative, or design leadership, including experience building or scaling a brand function at a high-growth company, agency, or in-house creative team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A portfolio of brand work you&#39;ve led end-to-end — identity systems, rebrands, or campaigns that measurably shaped how a company was perceived.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of hiring, developing, and leading high-performing creative teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong operational instincts: you&#39;ve built creative processes that scale, and you can explain them clearly — not just describe good taste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience using AI in creative production — not just a point of view on it, but actual workflows you&#39;ve built or adopted to scale output without diluting quality. You&#39;ve shipped things using generative tools, not just experimented with them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent craft across visual identity, typography, voice, and motion, with the judgment to know when to lead by example and when to delegate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort partnering with Marketing, Product, Sales, People, and executive leadership — strong written and verbal communication in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bias toward building and shipping over speccing and aligning — you&#39;d rather put a rough version in front of people this week than circulate a perfect brief next month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in fintech, B2B SaaS, or another trust-driven category — what matters most is a track record of building brands people remember, but the context helps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in Spanish and/or Portuguese, given Clara&#39;s footprint across MX, BR, CO, and AR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working directly with founders or C-level on brand-defining moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Startup or small-team experience where you owned something end to end, from idea to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

