&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Partnerships Expert to build Clara’s accountant and VAR channel in Mexico. This is a role for a seasoned professional who has already stood up a partner program with accounting firms, accountants, and software resellers — and who thrives in a player-coach mindset: designing the motion, recruiting the first hundred partners, and personally closing the deals that prove the channel. You will own demand generation through this channel end-to-end. There is no inherited program to babysit. You will build it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the channel: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and launch Clara’s partner program for accounting firms, BPOs, and value-added resellers of local accounting and ERP software. Map the landscape, pick the first cohorts, and get live referrals on the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own demand generation: &lt;/strong&gt;This seat is measured on qualified pipeline and converted volume sourced by the channel — not on logo count, signed MOUs, or partner-portal vanity metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be strategically hands-on: &lt;/strong&gt;Write the commercial offer (referral, co-sell, enablement — not a reseller cut on interchange), recruit anchor partners, run the first enablement sessions, and sit in the rooms that close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the GTM by partner type: &lt;/strong&gt;A national accounting firm, a local accounting-software VAR, and a mid-market ERP boutique do not sell the same way. Build a distinct motion, kit, and incentive for each profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate internally: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the bridge between partners and Product, Legal, Sales, Credit, and Customer Success so a referred company can go live without the partner losing face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Run the full partnership lifecycle: onboarding, enablement, QBRs, health scores, SLAs, and a clean cutoff for partners who do not produce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive growth: &lt;/strong&gt;Track partner-sourced leads, win rate, time-to-live, and transaction volume in HubSpot and Metabase. Double down on the partners who originate quality. Kill the ones who do not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow efficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Use Google Drive, Slack, and N8N to document the playbook and automate communication with the portfolio so the channel scales without a large ops bench.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Minimum 5 years in Partnerships, Channel, or Business Development building an indirect motion with accountants, Accounting firms, VARs, or SMB software partners in Mexico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel craft: Proven track record standing up (not only inheriting) a partner program — tiers, incentives, enablement, certification, and a referral or co-sell engine that produced measurable demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain: Strong working knowledge of the Mexican accounting and SMB-software landscape (accounting firms, CFDI workflows, local ERPs and accounting suites). You already know who influences the CFO and the contador.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution: High-impact delivery as a player-coach — strategy plus personal sourcing, negotiation, and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven: Evidence of partner-sourced pipeline and transaction or subscription growth through an indirect channel, not only brand partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-person collaboration: Based in Mexico City, hybrid, with regular time in the office and on the road with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy: Experience or strong interest in AI tools to automate partner workflows and increase coverage per head.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills: Independent work in Metabase, spreadsheets, SQL, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation: N8N, Slack integrations, or similar tools to run a partner portfolio without extra headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM discipline: Hands-on HubSpot (or equivalent) with partner-sourced attribution you actually trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech, payments, corporate cards, or expense-management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
