&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;Managing HR performance indicators and People Analytics processes via &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;70&quot;&gt;BambooHR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and other tools to support data-driven strategic decisions for the operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot;&gt;Participating in organizational development projects, focusing on improving the employee experience and fostering an inclusive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6,0&quot;&gt;Staying up-to-date with Mexican and LatAm market trends to implement innovations in both talent attraction and internal people operations.&lt;/p&gt;
