&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or building a design system: components, patterns or documentation that other designers used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough frontend knowledge to review implementation and open pull requests on what you designed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with structured, agent-ready guidelines, docs built for both humans and AI to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
