&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech or B2B products with complex, data-heavy UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-brand or multi-market systems, including localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having led or supported a migration from one component library to another.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic experience with Swift or Kotlin, enough to prototype and review implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI, GitHub Actions or visual regression tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
