&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Revenue Operations Specialist to connect Sales, Growth and Technology through reliable data, processes and working software. You&#39;ll own core sales operations and build, deploy and maintain applications, integrations and AI workflows that improve pipeline generation and conversion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find funnel bottlenecks. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with RevOps, Sales and Growth on prospecting, qualification, account assignment, pipeline generation and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritize practical solutions. &lt;/strong&gt;Translate ambiguous needs into engineering requirements and measurable success criteria, weighing commercial impact, implementation effort and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build connected applications. &lt;/strong&gt;Develop and deploy internal tools linking CRM, sales engagement, enrichment providers and spreadsheets through APIs, webhooks and code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate with AI. &lt;/strong&gt;Build account-research, enrichment, qualification, call-analysis and sales-enablement workflows with appropriate human review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep solutions reliable. &lt;/strong&gt;Debug failures, test changes, manage dependencies and restore functionality as requirements, APIs and models evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect business data. &lt;/strong&gt;Apply controls for customer data, credentials, access permissions, security and AI usage costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own everyday sales operations. &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain accurate CRM data, workflows, reporting and clear account ownership alongside development projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure commercial impact. &lt;/strong&gt;Validate cross-system metrics; track time saved, errors, lead response, adoption and pipeline outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make adoption sustainable. &lt;/strong&gt;Document purpose, dependencies, operation and recovery; create practical guides, gather user feedback and improve solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How you&#39;ll work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with RevOps, Sales and Growth leaders to turn commercial problems into deployable solutions, explaining technical choices and limitations in business terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using CRM data, SQL, Google Sheets and AI coding tools, you&#39;ll build and validate workflows, checking generated code and production behavior rather than relying on prompting alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue Operations, Sales Operations, Growth Operations, Business Systems or comparable business-and-technical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of B2B funnels, inbound and outbound motions, segmentation, pipeline generation and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and maintaining applications, integrations or automations used by others; independent projects and relevant portfolios count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Python or JavaScript/TypeScript, including reading, writing, debugging and maintaining code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL querying, joins, validation and analysis; strong Google Sheets skills covering lookups, pivot tables, logical formulas and data manipulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST APIs, webhooks, JSON, authentication, failure handling and synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git, deployment, environment variables, secrets management, logging, testing, dependency management and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on AI-assisted development with Claude, DeepSeek, Codex or comparable tools, including reviewing code, validating behavior and troubleshooting beyond prompting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgment on deterministic automation versus AI, human review, quality, cost, latency and sensitive data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major CRM administration, including data, workflows, reporting and integrations; HubSpot is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales engagement platforms such as Amplemarket, Outreach or Salesloft, and ability to learn new tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Careful ownership of commercial outcomes and technical reliability, balancing operations with development and communicating across commercial and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with n8n, Make, Zapier or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building lightweight web applications and internal interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating LLM APIs, structured outputs or tool calling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data warehouses, BI tools and enrichment providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, payments or fast-growing B2B companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative with a builder mindset&lt;/strong&gt; to help pioneer Clara’s next generation of outbound sales. This isn’t a traditional SDR role. You&#39;ll combine &lt;strong&gt;commercial instinct, experimentation, AI, and automation&lt;/strong&gt; to find better ways to identify, engage, and convert high-value prospects across Mexico &amp;amp; Colombia.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll own your pipeline while also helping us build the systems behind it: testing new tools, automating repetitive work, improving prospect data, and using AI to make outbound smarter and more personalized.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own outbound prospecting to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CFOs, Controllers, and senior finance leaders&lt;/strong&gt; at mid-market and enterprise companies across Latin America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;multi-channel outbound campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; across email, LinkedIn, WhatsApp, and other relevant channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt; to improve prospect research, account prioritization, personalization, and follow-up at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and experiment with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;automated workflows&lt;/strong&gt; that connect prospecting data, enrichment tools, CRM, and outreach platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive or inefficient parts of the sales process and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;build simple solutions to automate or improve them&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new AI tools, data sources, and workflows, quickly turning ideas into&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;small experiments or MVPs&lt;/strong&gt; and measuring their impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with multiple data sources and enrichment tools to create&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;high-quality prospect lists and buying signals&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously test messaging, targeting, sequences, channels, and automation to improve conversion throughout the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize Clara’s sales stack, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;HubSpot and Amplemarket&lt;/strong&gt;, enrichment platforms, and emerging AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with AEs, Sales Leadership, RevOps, and other teams to identify opportunities to make our outbound engine more scalable and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document successful experiments and turn them into&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;repeatable playbooks and workflows&lt;/strong&gt; for the broader sales organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Outbound Sales, SDR/BDR, Growth, RevOps, or sales automation&lt;/strong&gt; at a high-growth B2B company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of generating pipeline through outbound prospecting and engaging senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern sales tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Amplemarket, Apollo, Outreach, Salesloft, HubSpot, or LinkedIn Sales Navigator&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;AI tools and automation&lt;/strong&gt; as part of your day-to-day workflow—not just occasionally, but to meaningfully improve how you work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;builder mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re comfortable connecting tools, creating workflows, experimenting with new platforms, and figuring things out independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset and comfort using data to understand what is working, identify bottlenecks, and prioritize experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication—clear, human, persuasive, and tailored to senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, curiosity, and bias for action. You&#39;re comfortable testing something quickly, measuring the result, and iterating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automations with tools such as &lt;strong&gt;n8n, Make, Zapier&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;APIs, webhooks, data enrichment, scraping, or automated data workflows&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using generative AI or LLMs to automate &lt;strong&gt;research, lead qualification, personalization, or outbound workflows&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic comfort with &lt;strong&gt;SQL, scripting, or low-code/no-code tools&lt;/strong&gt;. You don&#39;t need to be an engineer, but being able to prototype your own solutions is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling an outbound motion &lt;strong&gt;from scratch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to or engaging &lt;strong&gt;finance and operations executives&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Fintech, SaaS, or the Latin American technology ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Your Sales Career at Clara&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Clara, we don’t just offer a sales job—we provide an environment designed for high performance, long-term wealth, and continuous career growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Leave Behind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have been in sales long enough, you know the industry’s bad habits. We actively reject them:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No “Rolodex” Hiring:&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t hire just for connections. We value professionals who actually care to learn our product, solve real customer problems, and know how to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No “Churn and Burn”:&lt;/strong&gt; We reject the revolving door culture. When we hire you, we invest in your quick success and long-term retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Clara Sales Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We engineered a transparent system built to help you win big:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Ownership (Uncapped Potential):&lt;/strong&gt; We deeply value the Individual Contributor. Our top-performing AEs consistently earn more than their managers, backed by absolutely zero commission caps and access to company equity. In our servant leadership model, even our CEO is building tools to help your productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Simplicity &amp;amp; #Clarity (Transparent Compensation):&lt;/strong&gt; No complex math required. Your variable compensation is directly aligned with business goals, with real-time visibility over your metrics so you always know exactly where you stand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Inclusivity (Teamwork Meets Territory):&lt;/strong&gt; We carve out clear, fair territories so you can autonomously run your own book of business, backed by a highly collaborative global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Pride (A Product That Delivers):&lt;/strong&gt; We build exceptional spend management products that actually solve the customer’s pain points, making your pitching process smoother and more impactful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#ABC (An Expanding Arsenal):&lt;/strong&gt; We never settle. Continuous platform innovation and new product launches mean you always have an ever-growing toolkit to cross-sell and hit your targets faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: you&#39;ll split your time between the office, customers and home. We don&#39;t set a minimum number of office days for most roles — you&#39;ll spend time in the office naturally, and most days during your ramp-up or when your leader asks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Sales Enablement Specialist in Sales Operations to own the Sales Academy, from onboarding through a three-month ramp and ongoing enablement. You&#39;ll build its curriculum, performance measurement and AI-powered app so new hires can turn learning into sales results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the full ramp journey. &lt;/strong&gt;Own the 30/60/90-day curriculum: product, ICP, sales methodology, tools and processes; then live calling, outbound sequences, pipeline generation and first deals; finally full quota accountability, ramp certification and graduation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create training that stays current. &lt;/strong&gt;Build playbooks, videos, reference guides, battle cards and interactive modules tailored to roles and markets. Extend enablement beyond onboarding through product launches, tool rollouts and messaging updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate learning at every milestone. &lt;/strong&gt;Design quizzes, practical evaluations and certification checkpoints. Define ramp benchmarks, report progress and flag at-risk new hires early so sales leaders can intervene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect learning to sales performance. &lt;/strong&gt;Unify module completion, test scores and certifications with activity, pipeline and conversion metrics in new-hire scorecards. Report knowledge absorption trends, performance correlations and curriculum gaps to Sales leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a self-service Academy app. &lt;/strong&gt;Create a central hub where new hires access learning paths, complete modules and assessments, and track progress, while sales leaders monitor ramp performance in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalize learning with AI. &lt;/strong&gt;Use performance patterns to adapt learning paths, surface at-risk indicators and generate coaching suggestions. Own the app roadmap and ongoing improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support reliable HubSpot administration. &lt;/strong&gt;Handle account assignments, reassignments and territory or segment changes. Resolve ownership disputes while maintaining accurate account data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the Sales book of business. &lt;/strong&gt;Own uploads and ongoing maintenance in HubSpot, ensuring accurate ownership and segmentation. Monitor and report adherence to assigned accounts and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How you&#39;ll work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with Sales leadership and subject matter experts to turn real examples, strong call recordings and proven plays into training. Run end-of-cohort retrospectives with new hires and their sales leaders to improve the Academy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build with AI and no-code/low-code tools without depending on engineering resources, connecting HubSpot, Amplemarket and Slack data with learning progress. Use that evidence to prioritize app and curriculum improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements for the role. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in sales enablement, learning and development, or sales operations, including designing and delivering onboarding or training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instructional design and facilitation that make knowledge usable across experience levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HubSpot administration, data management and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on daily AI use to build workflows or tools with ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No-code/low-code building with n8n, Bubble, Glide or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Google Sheets skills, including pivot tables, VLOOKUPs and logical functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LMS or enablement platforms such as Notion, Lessonly or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate performance data into curriculum decisions and build structured programs from scratch, with careful ownership of content and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience managing internal tools or apps through ongoing improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; — Diverse ideas, stories and perspectives build a better Clara.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the must-haves, apply — the nice-to-haves are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Security Engineer (Early Career)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will rotate across the security function in your first year, with real ownership from the first month. Expect the mix below to shift as the business does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure the AI posture, without blocking it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review how teams use LLMs, coding agents and AI tooling (Claude, agentic browsers, internal inference gateways) and help define guardrails that protect data without killing adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate our LLM-based investigation agent on the SIEM: catch hallucinated attributions, noisy alerts and conclusions the underlying data doesn&#39;t support, and tune its instructions before they reach production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the core skill of this role: knowing when to trust an AI-generated result and when to verify it by hand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build our view of prompt injection, data exfiltration through AI tools, and model/agent permissions as first-class risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud security on AWS and GCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage findings from AWS GuardDuty, GCP Security Command Center, IAM and network configuration reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run configuration and posture checks, and drive fixes with the owning teams instead of just filing tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our large-scale GCP project inventory and cleanup, and keep the central findings tracker honest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn Auth0, Cloudflare and Google Workspace security controls as they apply to identity, edge and SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure code and CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review internal tools, scripts and pull requests for the classics: hardcoded credentials, unsafe input handling, over-broad permissions, secrets in pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own SonarQube and dependency-scanning results for internal repositories: prioritize CVEs, follow up with developers, close the loop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review CI/CD changes that touch security-sensitive configuration (secrets, deployment access, IAM bindings)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help push secure-by-default patterns into how engineers actually work, including the code they generate with AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection, response and triage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and refine Splunk queries to investigate alerts from identity/SSO, cloud, endpoint, email and network sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain detection rules and dashboards; hunt down false positives and false negatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconstruct user activity timelines across systems and document findings with evidence, not just conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the EDR console, investigate suspicious endpoints, and execute containment (host isolation, quarantine) with a senior engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage phishing reports, analyze URLs and attachments in sandbox and threat-intel tools, maintain email and web filtering policies, and run phishing simulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate fast and clearly when a finding exceeds what you can close on your own, and work incidents through incident.io&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we look for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years in security, IT, software engineering or a related technical role. Internships, CTFs, bug bounties, open-source contributions and serious personal projects all count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of at least one of AWS or GCP: you know what IAM, security groups/VPC firewall rules, and a service account are, and you want to go much deeper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in the command line (bash), reading JSON and logs, and reading code in at least one common language (Python, JavaScript, Go) well enough to spot an obvious security issue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic familiarity with a log query language (SPL, KQL or similar), or the drive to become fluent quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptual understanding of identity and authentication: OAuth, SSO, MFA, service-to-service auth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using generative AI tools in a technical context, and a healthy skepticism about their output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A verify-before-you-conclude instinct: you never take a tool&#39;s, a vendor&#39;s or an AI agent&#39;s answer at face value without evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication in Spanish and English. Much of this job is explaining findings clearly to people who aren&#39;t security engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and pace: priorities change, the stack evolves, and you&#39;d rather learn on the job than wait for a course&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to a SIEM, EDR console (CrowdStrike, SentinelOne, Defender) or email/web security platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python or JavaScript for scripting and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any experience with SAST/dependency scanning tooling, secrets management or CI/CD security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience prompting or building with LLM APIs, agents or MCP tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entry-level certifications (Security+, AWS Cloud Practitioner, Google Cloud Digital Leader / Associate Cloud Engineer, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portuguese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to the full security surface of a regulated fintech in your first year: cloud, code, detection, response, compliance and AI, rather than a single queue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A senior team that pairs with you on investigations and reviews, and expects you to push back when the evidence doesn&#39;t hold&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct work on problems most security teams haven&#39;t solved yet: securing agentic AI in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A modern stack: AWS, GCP, Splunk, Auth0, Cloudflare, SonarQube, incident.io, Claude and internal AI tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget and time for certifications, conferences and the hacker community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast, transparent hiring: application review, a technical conversation about real scenarios (no gotcha puzzles), a practical exercise you can do in a few hours, and a conversation with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to stand out&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us something you&#39;ve built, broken or written: a repo, a CTF write-up, a bug report, a blog post, a detection rule. We care far more about how you think and how you learn than about the exact list of tools on your CV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first role: you&#39;ll work from home day to day. You&#39;ll ramp up in person with the team, and come together in person for team moments, events and customer visits through the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high talent-density team&lt;/strong&gt; driven to make an impact in Latin America — low ego, high ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options (ESOP) from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual learning budget and accelerated development paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English is our working language, with Spanish and Portuguese every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity&lt;/strong&gt; — Open and direct communication: we say what we mean and give context where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; — If it can be simpler, it should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; — We own everything we do, end to end. When something needs to happen, we don&#39;t wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride&lt;/strong&gt; — We hold ourselves to a high standard, and it shows in what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABC (Always Be Changing)&lt;/strong&gt; — We adapt fast, embrace change, and keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
