&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Fullstack Engineer to join Clara&#39;s Integrations team — the squad responsible for connecting Clara&#39;s financial platform to the ecosystem of ERPs, banks, payment processors, and enterprise systems that power our clients&#39; operations across Brazil, Mexico, and Colombia.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design and build the integrations, pipelines, and APIs that keep Clara&#39;s financial data flowing reliably across dozens of third-party connections. Fullstack here is real — several of our most important upcoming initiatives require building internal tooling and client-facing interfaces from scratch, and you&#39;ll be expected to own those end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is central to how we work on this team — you&#39;re expected to use it across the full development lifecycle, from design to deployment, and to reach for it whenever it makes you faster or better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain backend integrations with payment processors, ERP platforms, and financial infrastructure providers across Latin America&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect scalable, secure, and observable services that handle sensitive financial data with the reliability our clients depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own frontend interfaces when the initiative calls for it — internal tooling, integration dashboards, configuration UIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to automate repetitive engineering workflows, accelerate delivery, and close skill gaps — from scaffolding integrations to generating and reviewing code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical bar through code reviews, architectural input, and hands-on mentorship of junior and mid-level engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and Data to translate complex integration requirements into reliable, maintainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and tackle tech debt that creates operational risk or slows the team down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
