&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend software development experience, with at least 1–2 years working across the full stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software architecture and system design skills — you&#39;ve built systems that scale and fail gracefully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in one or more backend languages; our primary stack is Java / Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good frontend knowledge in one or more frontend language/framework (our stack is React)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated use of AI tools throughout the development process — design, coding, code review, debugging, and documentation. Experience using tools like Claude, Devin, or n8n to automate repetitive or complex engineering workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and comfort collaborating cross-functionally with Product, Design, and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
