&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a &lt;em&gt;Staff DevOps Engineer&lt;/em&gt; who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design, adoption, and continuous improvement of the Internal Developer Platform (IDP), driving CI/CD pipeline standardization to increase deployment frequency and reduce Cycle Time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FinOps Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement engineering FinOps strategy across AWS and other tooling, identifying cost-saving opportunities without compromising reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate and evolve our Kubernetes platform on Amazon EKS, supporting multi-country production workloads (MX/CO/BR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event-Driven Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Support and troubleshoot our Kafka/MSK-based event-driven architecture, used extensively across our microservices for async processing, notifications, and cross-service communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI/Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and integrate MCP-based (Model Context Protocol) or other applied-AI solutions to automate log analysis and accelerate Root Cause Analysis (RCA) during incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise development teams on scalable, secure infrastructure design; identify and mitigate technical debt in legacy systems; support cross-team architectural reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and maintain Least Privilege Access (IAM) models for both human and non-human identities, including peer review of policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SSDLC:&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthen the Secure Software Development Lifecycle through container standardization, secure base images, and pipeline hardening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical compliance initiatives for audits, certifications (e.g., ISO 27001), local fintech regulations, and enterprise integration RFPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement multi-account, multi-region backup and recovery systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and implement IaC for environment provisioning and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in on-call rotations, continuously improving MTTD/MTTR through effective monitoring and alerting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical support and mentorship to development teams adopting internal tooling (CLIs, container platforms, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in DevOps, Platform Engineering, or SRE roles, ideally in fintech or regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with multi-account, multi-region AWS (EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, IAM, or equivalent services).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes on Amazon EKS (cluster operations, scaling, networking, workload troubleshooting) in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Apache Kafka / Amazon MSK in production: topic design, consumer group management, performance tuning, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or contributing to the build of Internal Developer Platforms (IDP) and CI/CD standardization (GitHub Actions, self-hosted runners, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in observability and incident management (Datadog or similar) and DORA metrics (Cycle Time, CFR, MTTR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of cloud security: Least Privilege, SSDLC, and compliance frameworks (ISO 27001, PCI-DSS, or regional fintech regulations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Ruby, Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, Java; PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis; experience with our core stack of Java/Spring Boot microservices on Kubernetes (EKS) with Kafka/MSK for event-driven communication; familiarity with applying AI/LLMs to operational tasks (automated log analysis, MCPs, agents) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Skills &amp;amp; Pluses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a strategic mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner, adaptable to changes and willing to shift directions as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innate curiosity and an ability to thrive in an ambiguous and rapidly changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational skills to produce clear documentation and present to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native Spanish; intermediate-advanced English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
