&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clara is the leading platform in Latin America for companies to execute and manage every payment operation.&lt;/strong&gt; More than 50,000 leading and fast-growing businesses run on our corporate cards, bill pay, financing and B2B payments, and in 2025 the Financial Times named Clara the region’s fastest-growing company. We’re passionate about helping every company we work with become more effective—and, through that, raising the region’s competitiveness. We’re ~400 people, backed by Notable Capital, Coatue, Kaszek, monashees, DST Global, ICONIQ, General Catalyst and Goldman Sachs, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to provide senior individual-contributor technical leadership at Clara. This is an organization-level IC role: you shape architecture, raise engineering standards across pods, and multiply impact through design, code, and mentorship — &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; a people-manager position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a builder and a technical authority beyond a single pod. You still write production code regularly, but your scope is cross-team: systems that span services, shared platforms, and hard technical bets that unlock multiple product areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a builder&#39;s role first.&lt;/strong&gt; You are expected to ship code, lead by example in reviews and design docs, and leave clearer systems behind you — not only facilitate meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-team architecture&lt;/strong&gt; — Drive system design for initiatives that cut across pods (APIs, data models, event flows, reliability patterns). Hold a high bar on coherence, operability, and long-term cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering excellence&lt;/strong&gt; — Set and model standards for code quality, testing (TDD/BDD), observability, and secure design. Influence through RFCs, architecture reviews, and pairing — not through reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical strategy&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with Engineering Directors, Pod Leads, and Product on sequencing, tech debt, and platform investments. Make trade-offs explicit and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; leveling-up&lt;/strong&gt; — Grow Senior and Mid engineers via design reviews, deep pairing, and hiring signal. You provide strong input on technical fit; managers own career and performance outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident and reliability leadership&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead or co-lead response and remediation for high-severity incidents on systems you influence; drive durable fixes, not band-aids.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on delivery&lt;/strong&gt; — Author meaningful PRs. Staff at Clara is not an architecture-only title.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Don&#39;t Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1:1s, performance ratings, compensation, or PIPs — those belong to Engineering Managers / Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day sprint facilitation for a single pod (unless temporarily embedded); Pod Engineering Leads own pod execution rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering, including substantial time as a Senior / Lead IC on complex systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in at least one of:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Java (Spring / Spring Boot), microservices, scalable system design, PostgreSQL/MySQL and NoSQL data modeling, event-driven architectures (Kafka or similar), REST APIs, AWS, containers (Docker/Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; Production React + TypeScript at scale, component architecture, performance, testing (Jest, RTL, Cypress/Playwright), build/CI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work and reason &lt;strong&gt;full-stack&lt;/strong&gt; even if your depth is on one side: read the whole path from data model to API to UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing for high availability, security, and operability in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong testing culture (unit, integration, contract) and familiarity with CI/CD (GitHub Actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of written technical design that non-authors can challenge and execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated influence &lt;strong&gt;without&lt;/strong&gt; formal authority — across teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication of trade-offs to Product, Design, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product mindset: you engage roadmaps and feasibility, not only tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual honesty: change direction when evidence demands it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship instincts; you leave teams stronger than you found them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong English; Spanish is a plus for LATAM collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial applications, payments, or regulated LATAM markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Staff / Principal / Staff-equivalent title, or org-wide Tech Lead scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform or developer-experience investments (shared libraries, internal tools, AI-assisted engineering workflows).&lt;/li&gt;
