&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first role: you&#39;ll work from home day to day. You&#39;ll ramp up in person with the team, and come together in person for team moments, events and customer visits through the year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Clara&lt;/h2&gt;
